ир Володимирович\", \"Vladimir Vladimiroviç Putin\", \"Wladimir Putin\", \"Βλαντίμιρ Πούτιν\", \"Vladimir Vladimirovich POUTINE\", \"فلاديمير بوتين\", \"ভ্লাদিমির পুতিন\", \"Władimir Putin\", \"Vladímir Putin\", \"Vladímír Pútín\"], \"alias\": [\"Putyin elnök\", \"Vladimir Vladimirovici Putin\", \"Președintele Putin\", \"فلادمير بوتين\", \"В. В. Путин\", \"Βλαντίμιρ Βλαντίμιροβιτς Πούτιν\", \"Predsjednik Putin\", \"블라디미르 블라디미로비치 푸틴\", \"Władimir Władimirowicz Putin\", \"Vladimír Vladimirovič Putin\", \"Vladimir Putin\", \"فلاديمير بوتن\", \"فلادمير بوتن\", \"Vlagyimir Putyin\", \"Владимир Путин\", \"PUTIN, Vladimir\", \"Владимир Владимирович Путин\", \"Vladímir Vladímirovitx Putin\", \"Vladímir Vladímirovich Putin\", \"Vladimir Vladimirovitch Poutine\", \"Президент Путин\", \"Presidente Putin\", \"Putin Volodymyr Volodymyrovych\", \"Vladimir Vladimirovich Putin\", \"Presidente Vladimir Putin\", \"Wladimir Wladimirowitsj Poetin\", \"Vladimír Putin\", \"Путин Владимир Владимирович\", \"Vladimir Vladimirovitj Putin\", \"Путин, Владимир Владимирович\", \"فلاديمير فلاديميروفيتش بوتين\", \"Уладзімір Пуцін\", \"Путин В. В.\", \"владимир владимирович путин\", \"Путин Владимир\", \"Vladimir Vladimirovich POUTINE\", \"Путин, Владимир\", \"Präsident Putin\", \"Presiden Putin\", \"ПУ́ТИН Влади́мир Влади́мирович\"], \"notes\": [\"President of the Russian Federation\", \"President of the Russian Federation. Corruption.\", \"2nd and 4th President of Russia (2000-2008, 2012-present), 7th and 11th Prime Minister of Russia (1999-2000, 2008-2012), Director of the Federal Security Service (1998-1999) and Deputy Mayor of Saint Petersburg (1994-1996)\", \"(Date of UN designation: 2022-02-25)\", \"2nd and 4th President of Russia (2000–2008, 2012–present), 7th and 11th Prime Minister of Russia (1999–2000, 2008–2012), Director of the Federal Security Service (1998–1999) and Deputy Mayor of Saint Petersburg (1994–1996)\", \"As the President of Russia, he shapes the policy of the Russian government, which threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine.\", \"Disqualified\", \"Vladimir Poutine est le président de la Fédération de Russie. Le 22 février 2022, il a signé un décret reconnaissant l\'\\\"indépendance et la souveraineté\\\" des zones des oblasts ukrainiens de Donetsk et de Louhansk non contrôlées par le gouvernement, et a ordonné le déploiement des forces armées russes dans ces zones. Le 24 février 2022, il a ordonné le lancement d\'une opération militaire en Ukraine et les forces armées russes ont commencé à attaquer l\'Ukraine. Cette attaque est une violation flagrante de l\'intégrité territoriale, de la souveraineté et de l\'indépendance de l\'Ukraine. Vladimir Poutine est responsable d\'actions compromettant l\'intégrité territoriale, la souveraineté et l\'indépendance de l\'Ukraine, ou la stabilité ou la sécurité en Ukraine, et soutient activement ces actions.\", \"(also  Vladimir Vladimirovich PUTIN )\", \"NOT SUBJECT TO TRAVEL RESTRICTIONS ACCORDING TO ARTICLE 29(1)\", \"Vladimir Putin is the President of the Russian Federation. On 22 Feb 2022, he signed a decree recognising the \\\"independence and sovereignty\\\" of the non-government-controlled areas of the Donetsk and Luhansk oblasts of Ukraine, and ordered the Russian armed forces into those areas. On 24 Feb 2022, he ordered a military operation in Ukraine and Russian armed forces began an attack on Ukraine. That attack is a blatant violation of the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. Vladimir Putin is responsible for and actively supporting actions undermining the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, as well as stability and security in Ukraine.\", \"The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025.\", \"Function: President of the Russian Federation\"], \"title\": [\"His Excellency\"], \"gender\": [\"male\"], \"topics\": [\"corp.disqual\", \"sanction\", \"wanted\", \"export.control\"